@startuml
actor Admin
participant "Laravel System" as Laravel
participant "Asterisk PBX" as Asterisk
participant "AI Microservice (Python)" as AI
actor Lead

Admin -> Laravel: Request to initiate call
Laravel -> Asterisk: Trigger outbound SIP call
Asterisk -> Lead: Dial and connect
Asterisk -> Lead: Play greeting (TTS)
Lead -> Asterisk: Voice response
Asterisk -> AI: Send recorded audio or stream

AI -> AI: Speech-to-text (STT)
AI -> AI: Intent detection & GPT response
AI -> Asterisk: Send audio reply (TTS)
Asterisk -> Lead: Play AI-generated reply

loop Conversation
  Lead -> Asterisk: Voice reply
  Asterisk -> AI: Send audio
  AI -> AI: Transcribe + understand intent
  AI -> Asterisk: Send next TTS audio
  Asterisk -> Lead: Play AI-generated reply
end

AI -> Laravel: Update lead status
AI -> Laravel: Log transcription & predicted intent
Laravel -> Admin: Notify new conversations for review
Admin -> Laravel: Review and correct intents (optional)
Laravel -> AI: Trigger model retraining (periodic/manual)

Laravel --> Admin: Show updated lead status and analytics
@enduml
